How can CI/CD be used in data engineering?


**"CI/CD is an automated software development practice where Continuous Integration (CI) automatically builds and tests code whenever developers commit changes. Continuous Delivery (CD) prepares the application for release, while Continuous Deployment can automatically release it to production after all checks pass. In data engineering, CI/CD automates the testing and deployment of SQL scripts, ETL pipelines, and Snowflake database objects, reducing manual effort and improving reliability."

What is the role of SonarQube?


SonarQube is a code quality and security analysis tool used in a CI/CD pipeline to automatically inspect source code for bugs, vulnerabilities, and maintainability issues before the code is deployed.